            "created_at": "2025-09-18T08:43:31.398646+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where you decide which playstyle you want:\n\na. blizzard stacking\n     -Wall behind them then use cryofreeze to push them into said wall and tick off twice, while making it impossible to move due to two blizzards and liquid nitrogen, and applying insane team antiheal.\n\nb. in and out cryofreeze\n     -using the non-wall power such as Permafrost or Frostnova to directly buff cryofreeze.\n\nIf you have teammates that are running an ashe ap build, a soldier with a damaging biotic field ap build, an orisa with an ult build or any kind of dive winston this is the best playstyle you can run.\n---\n\nI personally perfer the first strategy as it confirms way more damage, however if yyou intend to not use your wall offensively like that you can take Permafrost or Frostnova. Permafrost increases your blizzard size by rougly 15% while Frost Nova deals a flat 90 extra damage when cryofreeze ends at 50 ap, however I advice against taking frostnova due to the fact that you do not wish to be near enemies during the end of your cryofreeze",
